WEBVTT

01:29.180 --> 01:34.360
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.759 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 18]

01:41.950 --> 01:43.000
Go home.

01:45.140 --> 01:46.190
Brat.

01:48.539 --> 01:49.940
Why are you hiding so far?

01:50.289 --> 01:52.090
It took me a long time to get here.

01:52.440 --> 01:53.370
Why are you here?

01:54.470 --> 01:56.600
Run away from home? Are you a teenager?

01:57.390 --> 01:58.110
Who are you?

01:59.150 --> 02:00.770
Do you want me to beat you?

02:01.890 --> 02:03.660
Don't you all want me to leave?

02:03.690 --> 02:05.220
Just pretend that I'm gone.

02:05.230 --> 02:06.290
That's different.

02:06.960 --> 02:08.410
Going abroad is

02:08.650 --> 02:09.750
for a bright future.

02:09.750 --> 02:11.500
Now what you did can get you nothing.

02:11.500 --> 02:12.560
What are you doing?

02:13.890 --> 02:15.240
Caring about my life?

02:16.740 --> 02:18.070
Where is the agreement?

02:21.370 --> 02:23.170
You're so straightforward now.

02:23.930 --> 02:25.590
I'm always straightforward.

02:25.670 --> 02:26.930
But I have a condition.

02:28.760 --> 02:29.690
I knew it.

02:30.060 --> 02:31.990
You're not that straightforward.

02:32.090 --> 02:32.930
What is it?

02:34.480 --> 02:35.410
I...

02:39.180 --> 02:40.540
My bank card...

02:42.800 --> 02:44.700
That's your dad's style.

02:46.860 --> 02:48.140
What's your plan?

02:50.710 --> 02:51.630
Anyway, the shareholding

02:51.630 --> 02:52.079
has nothing

02:52.079 --> 02:53.120
to do with me.

02:54.050 --> 02:56.110
The only thing I care about now is that

02:57.680 --> 02:58.360
I don't want to live here

02:58.360 --> 02:59.620
with Zhou Wan forever.

03:00.320 --> 03:02.780
I need to think about
what to do in the future.

03:04.970 --> 03:05.640
Deal.

03:08.070 --> 03:09.220
Zhou Wan, come out.

03:23.010 --> 03:25.010
Ms. Lan, why are you here?

03:26.590 --> 03:28.450
You two are living a happy life now

03:28.470 --> 03:29.670
and even have a puppy.

03:29.920 --> 03:30.640
Xiaoliu.

03:31.180 --> 03:31.870
It's Zhou Xiaoliu.

03:31.870 --> 03:32.360
Yes.

03:32.360 --> 03:33.280
You even named it.

03:33.280 --> 03:34.540
Are you playing house?

03:35.380 --> 03:36.340
Don't worry.

03:36.500 --> 03:38.100
I'm not here to take him away.

03:38.310 --> 03:39.400
I'm just here to see

03:39.540 --> 03:41.310
how Xixiao is doing.

03:42.130 --> 03:43.329
I didn't expect that.

03:43.800 --> 03:44.140
It's fine.

03:44.140 --> 03:46.800
Lu Xixiao, who has been living
a luxurious life,

03:48.690 --> 03:50.350
is tougher than I thought.

03:51.470 --> 03:53.310
I wonder who influenced him.

03:55.260 --> 03:56.640
Of course, me.

03:58.340 --> 03:59.720
He has always been good.

03:59.960 --> 04:00.830
Always?

04:01.760 --> 04:03.380
Can you flirt after I leave?

04:03.520 --> 04:04.830
It's too cheesy.

04:06.420 --> 04:07.090
Alright.

04:07.480 --> 04:09.160
I'll go back to Pingchuan now.

04:09.470 --> 04:10.870
Take care of yourselves.

04:11.750 --> 04:13.400
Don't worry about the rest.

04:14.960 --> 04:16.290
I must see you off, Aunt.

04:16.290 --> 04:17.470
No need. Stop pretending.

04:17.470 --> 04:18.810
I don't need it.

04:18.839 --> 04:20.190
I'm seeing you off with sincerity.

04:20.190 --> 04:21.690
Go back. It's too cold.

04:22.310 --> 04:23.310
Thank you, Aunt.

04:24.380 --> 04:26.380
Changed the way you address me, huh?

04:26.620 --> 04:28.750
Wear more when you come here next time.

04:42.190 --> 04:43.750
Time to eat.

04:45.340 --> 04:46.580
Let's go.

04:48.159 --> 04:49.120
Time to eat.

04:49.190 --> 04:49.920
You're back.

04:50.720 --> 04:51.760
Come and eat.

04:59.000 --> 04:59.800
It tastes bad?

05:01.940 --> 05:03.000
It's so delicious.

05:04.130 --> 05:06.130
But why is this taste a bit familiar?

05:06.570 --> 05:07.380
Xixiao,

05:07.510 --> 05:10.040
you haven't taken
the Cola chicken wings yet.

05:15.000 --> 05:16.920
I cooked those three dishes, really.

05:16.920 --> 05:17.430
I knew it.

05:17.430 --> 05:18.870
-You fooled me with the restaurant dishes.
-I can't hear you.

05:18.870 --> 05:19.800
I can't hear you.

05:29.970 --> 05:30.650
Hello?

05:31.510 --> 05:32.490
Zhou Wan.

05:33.510 --> 05:34.800
Do you know who I am?

05:37.800 --> 05:40.130
I think it's time

05:40.159 --> 05:41.510
to talk to you.

05:43.220 --> 05:43.920
You are

05:43.920 --> 05:45.270
more pragmatic

05:45.270 --> 05:46.000
than him.

05:46.540 --> 05:48.400
I believe things will be smoother

05:48.720 --> 05:50.040
by talking with you.

05:51.720 --> 05:52.650
What do you mean?

05:53.270 --> 05:54.310
Ten years ago,

05:54.310 --> 05:56.630
your father Zhou Jun's
construction factory

05:56.630 --> 05:57.159
almost caused an accident

05:57.159 --> 05:58.750
due to a batch of

05:58.750 --> 06:01.070
jerry-built construction materials.

06:01.070 --> 06:03.800
This has something to do with Guo Yan.

06:03.800 --> 06:04.730
Do you know that?

06:07.480 --> 06:08.680
Jun'an Building Materials Factory

06:08.680 --> 06:10.810
has been investigated by the authorities

06:10.810 --> 06:13.280
-according to the law.
-Pay us! Pay back!

06:13.310 --> 06:14.770
-It's informed that Zhou, the boss...
-Sir.

06:14.770 --> 06:16.010
Don't take the fridge.

06:16.010 --> 06:17.240
There's something inside, sir.

06:17.240 --> 06:17.920
Go away.

06:17.940 --> 06:20.120
It is a matter of course
to pay your debts.

06:20.120 --> 06:20.750
It belongs to

06:20.750 --> 06:21.910
my family.

06:22.050 --> 06:23.310
Your factory has been emptied.

06:23.310 --> 06:23.710
You...

06:23.950 --> 06:24.430
You...

06:24.720 --> 06:26.510
It is a matter of course
to pay your debts.

06:26.510 --> 06:27.430
Let's go. Take the furniture.

06:27.430 --> 06:28.560
Sir, this fridge...

06:28.630 --> 06:29.310
Grandma!

06:30.500 --> 06:31.060
Move!

06:34.720 --> 06:36.070
We won't take it if you return the money.

06:36.070 --> 06:37.390
Hurry up. Take it away.

06:37.390 --> 06:38.070
Okay.

06:43.450 --> 06:45.380
I did it for the sake of the factory.

06:45.400 --> 06:47.390
You gave all the money to the workers.

06:47.390 --> 06:49.330
That's why I went to the suppliers.

06:51.040 --> 06:52.500
It's a significant thing.

06:52.920 --> 06:53.800
Why didn't you

06:53.800 --> 06:54.730
discuss with me?

06:55.000 --> 06:56.630
Look what a mess you've caused!

06:56.630 --> 06:58.120
Our products aren't

06:58.240 --> 06:58.870
selling well.

06:58.870 --> 06:59.870
How can we

06:59.870 --> 07:00.720
pay the workers' salaries?

07:00.720 --> 07:01.920
Why are you blaming me?

07:01.920 --> 07:02.720
What do you mean?

07:02.720 --> 07:05.050
I don't want to see this situation either.

07:07.270 --> 07:08.510
As far as I know,

07:08.940 --> 07:10.030
before that,

07:10.050 --> 07:11.040
Guo Yan

07:11.040 --> 07:12.950
has been working in procurement

07:12.950 --> 07:15.300
at your father's company for many years.

07:15.490 --> 07:16.940
She knew

07:17.070 --> 07:18.870
what the consequences would be.

07:19.410 --> 07:21.940
But in the end,

07:22.600 --> 07:25.530
Zhou Jun is the only one
who bore the responsibility.

07:26.060 --> 07:27.270
How did you know?

07:29.680 --> 07:31.190
Guo Xiangling is in the Lu family,

07:31.190 --> 07:32.270
by my side.

07:32.720 --> 07:34.800
How can I not investigate

07:34.800 --> 07:35.950
her background?

07:36.680 --> 07:37.510
So you knew

07:37.510 --> 07:38.920
my relationship with Guo Yan?

07:38.920 --> 07:40.180
That's not important.

07:40.740 --> 07:42.340
What matters is your choice.

07:42.950 --> 07:43.920
You're Guo Yan's daughter.

07:43.920 --> 07:45.460
I know what you want.

07:46.190 --> 07:46.870
Tell me.

07:47.890 --> 07:48.930
Name your price.

07:51.300 --> 07:52.200
Name the price?

07:53.780 --> 07:55.540
I want to make a deal with you.

07:57.770 --> 07:58.570
Impossible.

08:02.190 --> 08:03.630
You know Xixiao gave up

08:03.630 --> 08:04.240
the life

08:04.240 --> 08:06.190
he should have.

08:06.670 --> 08:08.600
You've already benefited from it.

08:09.280 --> 08:10.010
Zhou Wan.

08:10.230 --> 08:12.320
Xixiao is used to living a good life.

08:12.360 --> 08:13.630
Regardless of

08:13.630 --> 08:14.750
what your purpose is,

08:14.750 --> 08:15.910
I said it's impossible!

08:15.910 --> 08:17.640
do you really think

08:18.400 --> 08:20.330
you two can take care of each other?

08:21.500 --> 08:23.100
Have you thought about this?

08:24.120 --> 08:24.920
You'd better send

08:24.920 --> 08:26.450
Lu Xixiao back.

08:26.830 --> 08:28.340
As long as you send him back,

08:28.340 --> 08:29.510
I can promise you

08:30.070 --> 08:31.360
whatever you want.

08:31.620 --> 08:32.720
I promise you

08:35.330 --> 08:37.330
I can give you time to think about it.

08:37.840 --> 08:39.030
But it won't be long.

08:40.480 --> 08:41.809
I'll wait for your call.

08:55.200 --> 08:57.060
What's up? Why aren't you eating?

09:00.090 --> 09:01.220
I'm waiting for you.

09:02.890 --> 09:04.820
Why are you waiting for me? Kick me?

09:08.030 --> 09:08.890
Why are you waiting for me?

09:08.890 --> 09:09.490
Eat.

09:11.320 --> 09:12.520
I want to eat with you.

09:19.080 --> 09:20.370
I want to bet 5 yuan.

09:21.330 --> 09:22.080
These chicken wings are

09:22.080 --> 09:24.480
definitely not as delicious
as what I made.

09:28.970 --> 09:29.560
Try it.

09:30.550 --> 09:31.390
Thank you.

09:53.480 --> 09:54.240
I got a call from the cram school

09:54.240 --> 09:55.440
a couple of days ago.

09:57.550 --> 09:58.440
Can we join it?

10:00.030 --> 10:00.510
Yes.

10:00.510 --> 10:01.510
But he told me

10:01.510 --> 10:02.840
to go back and get a file.

10:03.720 --> 10:05.250
School registration file?

10:06.120 --> 10:06.840
I think so.

10:07.360 --> 10:09.480
So, in the next two days,

10:10.120 --> 10:11.240
we need to go back.

10:11.270 --> 10:12.030
No.

10:13.630 --> 10:14.270
Why?

10:16.350 --> 10:17.810
Well,

10:19.150 --> 10:20.240
this issue

10:20.240 --> 10:22.440
can be solved in one or two days.

10:23.360 --> 10:25.120
Let me go back for two days
to get our files.

10:25.120 --> 10:26.480
You stay here and take care of Xiaoliu.

10:26.480 --> 10:27.480
Don't go back alone.

10:27.480 --> 10:29.290
We won't stay there very long.

10:29.480 --> 10:30.880
Two or three days at most.

10:32.370 --> 10:33.440
And I still have a lot

10:33.440 --> 10:34.150
to pack.

10:34.530 --> 10:36.530
I didn't get enough stuff this time.

10:36.790 --> 10:37.390
We will just stay there for several days.

10:37.390 --> 10:39.650
I'll worry about you if you go back alone.

10:43.040 --> 10:44.640
How about we go back secretly

10:45.630 --> 10:46.270
and

10:46.750 --> 10:47.610
come back soon?

10:48.150 --> 10:48.790
Be quiet.

10:48.790 --> 10:49.850
Don't tell anyone.

11:02.210 --> 11:02.730
Okay.

11:05.120 --> 11:06.240
Before we leave,

11:07.550 --> 11:08.750
go somewhere with me.

11:36.410 --> 11:38.000
Why do you want to come here?

11:39.360 --> 11:40.870
It's

11:43.250 --> 11:44.200
because we've agreed

11:44.200 --> 11:45.460
to let go of everything

11:45.980 --> 11:47.270
and start over.

11:47.710 --> 11:48.770
Then, we should...

11:50.080 --> 11:50.880
Wait a minute.

11:51.130 --> 11:52.680
Don't act tough.

11:55.310 --> 11:56.000
-Are you okay?
-Wait.

11:56.000 --> 11:56.440
Wait.

11:59.590 --> 12:00.660
Look forward.

12:00.690 --> 12:01.630
The scenery is great.

12:01.630 --> 12:02.810
It's okay.

12:04.520 --> 12:05.310
I'm here.

12:08.160 --> 12:08.860
Yes.

12:09.680 --> 12:11.340
With you here, I'm not afraid.

12:13.450 --> 12:13.940
Okay.

12:17.500 --> 12:18.630
I'll hold your hand.

12:19.490 --> 12:20.130
Okay.

12:21.710 --> 12:22.390
Okay.

12:30.790 --> 12:31.870
Actually,

12:31.890 --> 12:32.840
the scenery in your eyes

12:32.840 --> 12:33.870
is different.

12:34.900 --> 12:36.070
Look up at the sky.

12:37.130 --> 12:38.060
Look at the sky.

12:38.520 --> 12:39.640
The sky is the same.

12:43.310 --> 12:44.830
It's so beautiful here.

12:54.670 --> 12:56.220
Close your eyes.

12:56.330 --> 12:57.140
Follow me.

13:02.300 --> 13:03.190
I'm here.

13:14.000 --> 13:14.880
Take your time.

13:17.770 --> 13:19.000
I'm here.

13:30.950 --> 13:31.830
Lu Xixiao,

13:33.590 --> 13:35.250
you're not afraid of heights.

13:36.210 --> 13:37.670
You're afraid of falling.

13:40.400 --> 13:41.150
But now,

13:41.150 --> 13:42.270
we are together.

13:44.050 --> 13:45.250
Even if we fall,

13:46.400 --> 13:48.260
we will fly together.

13:50.210 --> 13:51.210
Not falling

13:52.300 --> 13:53.340
but flying.

14:04.910 --> 14:06.320
You're amazing.

14:07.030 --> 14:07.670
You've already finished

14:07.670 --> 14:08.840
half of it.

14:08.960 --> 14:09.620
Really?

14:13.010 --> 14:13.830
Not bad.

14:16.570 --> 14:17.480
Where are we?

14:22.550 --> 14:24.150
Do you want to open your eyes?

14:25.720 --> 14:26.580
Open your eyes.

14:29.720 --> 14:30.900
I think I can.

14:33.220 --> 14:35.420
Don't be afraid. I'm holding your hand.

14:39.970 --> 14:40.790
No, no.

14:45.120 --> 14:46.440
Don't look down.

14:46.470 --> 14:48.150
No, I can't.

14:48.580 --> 14:49.400
I can't.

14:49.790 --> 14:50.750
Look forward.

14:50.750 --> 14:52.950
-I can't. Really.
-There's a mountain.

14:53.270 --> 14:54.440
Look far away.

14:55.080 --> 14:56.000
There's wind.

14:58.820 --> 15:00.010
Look up at the sky.

15:01.800 --> 15:03.330
There are clouds in the sky.

15:03.600 --> 15:04.310
Look.

15:05.960 --> 15:07.090
Look over there.

15:08.060 --> 15:09.200
No.

15:10.720 --> 15:11.790
Look at me.

15:12.200 --> 15:13.200
I'm with you.

15:14.850 --> 15:15.920
Idiot!

15:17.500 --> 15:18.230
No!

15:27.510 --> 15:28.240
Are you okay?

15:40.240 --> 15:41.510
Are you still scared?

15:42.430 --> 15:43.550
I feel better now.

15:47.250 --> 15:48.740
♪ If you had ever seen the fireflies ♪

15:50.380 --> 15:52.090
♪ Inside my eyes ♪

15:52.040 --> 15:53.090
From now on,

15:54.750 --> 15:56.200
let's look forward.

15:55.050 --> 15:56.750
♪ I think you would understand ♪

15:57.360 --> 15:58.760
Go higher.

15:58.410 --> 16:00.590
♪ Why I embrace the dark ♪

16:03.140 --> 16:05.070
♪ People always want to reach out ♪

16:06.370 --> 16:08.820
♪ But are afraid
to pull their hands back ♪

16:10.020 --> 16:12.490
♪ I choose to open my arms wide ♪

16:13.600 --> 16:15.340
♪ And enjoy the weightlessness ♪

16:19.050 --> 16:20.750
♪ If I could, I want to become ♪

16:22.490 --> 16:24.020
♪ An astronomer ♪

16:26.950 --> 16:28.620
♪ Lost in your night sky ♪

16:30.430 --> 16:32.880
♪ Then fall and fall and fall ♪

16:34.980 --> 16:36.980
♪ Maybe it's your gravity ♪

16:38.480 --> 16:40.670
♪ That held me back from losing control ♪

16:42.000 --> 16:44.490
♪ When you passed by me by accident ♪

16:45.920 --> 16:49.870
♪ I finally learned to fall ♪

16:50.520 --> 16:51.420
It's snowing.

16:52.820 --> 16:54.250
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

16:54.910 --> 16:56.460
♪ No time left, so I ♪

16:56.900 --> 16:59.210
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

17:00.880 --> 17:03.570
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

17:02.410 --> 17:03.560
It's snowing.

17:03.580 --> 17:04.680
It's snowing.

17:03.730 --> 17:07.390
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

17:08.560 --> 17:09.560
It's snowing.

17:09.010 --> 17:11.640
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

17:09.589 --> 17:10.960
It's snowing.

17:11.740 --> 17:15.460
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

17:17.300 --> 17:18.470
♪ Suddenly I am certain ♪

17:18.500 --> 17:21.200
♪ This mud all over me ♪

17:22.349 --> 17:24.960
♪ Is the proof of love ♪

17:41.160 --> 17:42.860
♪ If I could, I want to become ♪

17:44.600 --> 17:45.770
♪ An astronomer ♪

17:49.070 --> 17:50.740
♪ Lost in your night sky ♪

17:52.540 --> 17:54.990
♪ Then fall and fall and fall ♪

17:57.090 --> 17:59.090
♪ Maybe it's your gravity ♪

18:00.590 --> 18:02.780
♪ That held me back from losing control ♪

18:04.110 --> 18:06.600
♪ When you passed by me by accident ♪

18:08.030 --> 18:11.980
♪ Our paths suddenly overlap ♪

18:09.560 --> 18:10.390
Lu Xixiao,

18:14.330 --> 18:16.250
let's go see the vast world together,

18:14.930 --> 18:16.360
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

18:17.020 --> 18:18.390
♪ No time left, so I ♪

18:17.880 --> 18:19.210
walk on the broad road,

18:19.010 --> 18:21.130
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

18:20.950 --> 18:22.010
be happy every day,

18:22.990 --> 18:25.680
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

18:24.330 --> 18:25.830
and be safe and sound every year.

18:25.830 --> 18:29.260
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

18:31.120 --> 18:33.750
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

18:33.310 --> 18:33.750
Okay.

18:33.850 --> 18:37.280
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

18:39.410 --> 18:40.580
♪ Suddenly I am certain ♪

18:40.610 --> 18:43.310
♪ This mud all over me ♪

18:44.460 --> 18:46.810
♪ Is the proof of love ♪

19:07.190 --> 19:08.650
♪ I can't remember and can't go back ♪

19:08.720 --> 19:10.790
♪ If you can't hold it tightly, let me ♪

19:10.870 --> 19:12.850
♪ Fly without hesitation ♪

19:14.870 --> 19:17.360
♪ Sorry, I'm too capricious and obsessed ♪

19:18.110 --> 19:21.170
♪ The Milky Way is drowning ♪

19:22.960 --> 19:25.600
♪ If one day you fall into ♪

19:25.680 --> 19:30.020
♪ The gap a light-year away ♪

19:32.780 --> 19:34.480
♪ You'll find ♪

19:34.690 --> 19:36.930
♪ The scattered ashes ♪

19:38.370 --> 19:43.290
♪ Burns my heart ♪

20:11.220 --> 20:12.390
Let's make a wish.

20:15.000 --> 20:15.790
Just make a wish

20:15.790 --> 20:17.590
that we can be together forever.

20:20.890 --> 20:21.370
Okay.

20:23.580 --> 20:24.140
Come on.

20:26.000 --> 20:28.590
Three, two, one.

20:58.850 --> 21:00.570
This flower is so beautiful.

21:00.060 --> 21:03.300
[Virtues and Responsibilities]

21:01.320 --> 21:02.580
It suits me, right?

21:03.920 --> 21:05.160
Two days ago, we talked about

21:05.160 --> 21:06.830
that you didn't even attend

21:06.960 --> 21:08.440
the training for the physical competition
when you were in Grade 11.

21:08.440 --> 21:09.550
You said that it was because
your grandma was sick,

21:09.550 --> 21:10.300
right?

21:10.680 --> 21:11.400
If you

21:11.400 --> 21:12.270
had atteneded the competition

21:12.270 --> 21:13.660
together with Jiang Yan

21:13.880 --> 21:14.920
and won the award,

21:14.920 --> 21:16.960
you would have guaranteed admission.

21:16.960 --> 21:17.550
But at that time,

21:17.550 --> 21:18.400
when we were chatting,

21:18.400 --> 21:19.400
we all agreed that

21:19.830 --> 21:21.390
whether you or Jiang Yan

21:21.590 --> 21:22.440
was guaranteed admission,

21:22.440 --> 21:23.030
the remaining one

21:23.030 --> 21:24.790
must be the potential
of Huaqing University.

21:24.790 --> 21:25.750
What a pity.

21:26.000 --> 21:27.270
It's not a pity.

21:27.770 --> 21:29.370
Just prepare well this year.

21:30.700 --> 21:32.030
Sorry to make you worry.

21:32.110 --> 21:33.640
I will study hard this year.

21:35.550 --> 21:36.830
It's never too late

21:36.830 --> 21:38.360
to turn over a new leaf, huh?

21:38.570 --> 21:39.730
Lu Xixiao.

21:40.880 --> 21:42.270
Sir.

21:42.310 --> 21:43.470
You brat.

21:43.830 --> 21:45.450
If you had come to your senses earlier,

21:45.450 --> 21:46.070
I wouldn't have

21:46.070 --> 21:47.870
lost so much hair out of anxiety.

21:48.490 --> 21:49.160
I'm sorry.

21:50.370 --> 21:51.580
You've grown up.

21:51.880 --> 21:53.610
You even bought flowers for me.

21:54.310 --> 21:55.110
Here, take it.

21:55.550 --> 21:56.200
Thank you.

21:56.200 --> 21:56.880
Mr. Zhao,

21:56.880 --> 21:58.310
they are going to collect their files
to retake their senior year.

21:58.310 --> 21:59.230
Why didn't you come earlier?

21:59.230 --> 22:00.240
You should have come

22:00.240 --> 22:01.240
right after the college entrance exam.

22:01.240 --> 22:02.030
The re-take students have been studying

22:02.030 --> 22:02.920
for some time.

22:02.940 --> 22:04.130
Where have you been?

22:04.220 --> 22:04.830
Yeah.

22:05.480 --> 22:06.810
What were you thinking?

22:07.070 --> 22:08.030
We

22:09.790 --> 22:11.050
went to watch the snow.

22:13.270 --> 22:14.350
It's summer.

22:14.480 --> 22:16.250
Yes, it's summer.

22:16.270 --> 22:17.930
We watched the snow in summer.

22:21.330 --> 22:22.810
It's good to go for a walk.

22:23.070 --> 22:23.960
Zhou Wan is smart

22:23.960 --> 22:25.090
and has good grades.

22:25.270 --> 22:27.270
No matter which school you go to,
things won't be different.

22:27.270 --> 22:28.730
Don't feel too pressured.

22:29.510 --> 22:30.480
How about you?

22:30.680 --> 22:31.610
How are you feeling?

22:31.610 --> 22:32.640
Does your stomach still hurt?

22:32.640 --> 22:33.790
I'm fine now.

22:33.790 --> 22:35.520
See, I take medicine every day.

22:36.880 --> 22:38.310
You have to eat on time

22:38.350 --> 22:39.240
and regularly.

22:39.240 --> 22:40.700
I know. Go ahead.

22:41.100 --> 22:41.680
Meng.

22:41.750 --> 22:42.590
Hello, Wan.

22:42.920 --> 22:43.640
Why didn't you tell me that

22:43.640 --> 22:45.080
you two came back?

22:45.240 --> 22:46.420
Jiang Fan told me this news just now.

22:46.420 --> 22:47.590
We just arrived.

22:48.220 --> 22:49.140
Wait a minute.

22:49.890 --> 22:50.980
You are taller.

22:51.640 --> 22:52.640
Hello, Gu Meng.

22:53.510 --> 22:54.870
I'm Ms. Zhang.

22:54.920 --> 22:55.440
Can't you figure out

22:55.440 --> 22:56.310
my voice?

22:57.110 --> 22:58.510
Okay, talk with Zhou Wan.

22:58.680 --> 22:59.510
Gu Meng is here, too.

22:59.510 --> 23:01.370
She wants to have dinner with you.

23:02.790 --> 23:04.160
You made appointments with many people.

23:04.160 --> 23:05.160
Okay, see you later.

23:05.160 --> 23:06.290
Send me the address.

23:06.480 --> 23:07.040
Okay.

23:07.580 --> 23:08.100
Bye.

23:09.350 --> 23:10.480
Go ahead. They are waiting for you.

23:10.480 --> 23:11.310
Go. Go.

23:11.440 --> 23:13.300
-It's a rare gathering.
-Come on.

23:13.400 --> 23:14.510
We'll leave now.

23:14.510 --> 23:15.350
OK. Good luck.

23:15.350 --> 23:16.610
I believe you can do it.

23:16.880 --> 23:20.550
[Virtues and Responsibilities]

23:17.640 --> 23:18.510
Take care of yourself, too.

23:18.510 --> 23:18.880
Okay.

23:19.310 --> 23:20.920
Learn from Zhou Wan

23:21.920 --> 23:23.430
and try to get into the same university.

23:23.430 --> 23:24.120
Okay?

23:25.790 --> 23:27.160
-Supervise and urge him.
-Bye.

23:27.160 --> 23:27.960
-Go! Go!
-Bye.

23:27.960 --> 23:29.270
-Bye.
-Bye.

23:32.680 --> 23:33.200
On my way back,

23:33.200 --> 23:34.160
I told them.

23:35.550 --> 23:36.160
She asked us

23:36.160 --> 23:37.560
to have dinner with them.

23:38.070 --> 23:39.510
Okay, let's go.

23:40.560 --> 23:41.820
We're at school.

24:13.380 --> 24:14.050
Mr. Lu.

24:14.360 --> 24:15.160
Just now,

24:15.160 --> 24:17.130
there was a call from school.

24:17.370 --> 24:19.530
The two were collecting their files.

24:19.560 --> 24:21.120
They're in Pingchuan.

24:21.490 --> 24:22.510
Take him back.

24:23.770 --> 24:25.310
By the way, today,

24:25.310 --> 24:26.160
Madam will

24:26.160 --> 24:27.000
also come back.

24:27.000 --> 24:27.790
I guess

24:27.790 --> 24:28.880
she has gotten off the plane now.

24:28.880 --> 24:30.640
You can handle this.

24:30.640 --> 24:31.930
From now on,

24:31.950 --> 24:34.080
you don't have to tell me these things.

24:34.550 --> 24:36.960
But don't you

24:36.960 --> 24:37.550
need

24:37.550 --> 24:38.790
to talk with the girl…

24:38.830 --> 24:41.270
That little girl is so stubborn.

24:41.270 --> 24:42.550
Now that he's already back,

24:42.550 --> 24:43.310
I don't need to

24:43.310 --> 24:44.760
negotiate

24:44.920 --> 24:46.320
a childish deal with her.

24:46.400 --> 24:48.270
As for Guo Xiangling,

24:48.880 --> 24:50.350
the wedding was a mess.

24:50.350 --> 24:52.240
I lost my face.

24:53.200 --> 24:54.160
I couldn't make a proper explanation

24:54.160 --> 24:55.200
to the shareholders.

24:55.200 --> 24:56.030
Yes.

25:01.110 --> 25:03.770
We didn't get the marriage
certificate anyway.

25:03.840 --> 25:05.370
There's no need to keep her.

25:05.760 --> 25:06.430
Got it.

25:09.240 --> 25:10.240
Okay, I see.

25:11.550 --> 25:12.270
If we leave this time,

25:12.270 --> 25:12.920
it's hard to tell

25:12.920 --> 25:13.480
when we can come back.

25:13.480 --> 25:15.010
Bring everything you need.

25:15.030 --> 25:15.890
Take your time.

25:17.240 --> 25:17.880
Then, tell me

25:17.880 --> 25:19.140
as soon as you've done.

25:19.240 --> 25:21.100
Let's buy tickets earlier, okay?

25:21.680 --> 25:22.410
Don't worry.

25:27.420 --> 25:28.550
I'll tell you later.

25:37.020 --> 25:37.780
Xixiao.

25:44.480 --> 25:45.880
Mr. Lu

25:45.880 --> 25:47.870
heard you had come back.

25:48.400 --> 25:50.700
He wants to talk to you.

25:51.000 --> 25:51.440
If there's anything,

25:51.440 --> 25:52.570
just let him call me.

25:53.270 --> 25:54.510
But you didn't

25:54.530 --> 25:56.650
answer his calls.

25:57.310 --> 25:59.400
Or should I ask

25:59.420 --> 26:01.590
Miss Zhou to come with you?

26:01.620 --> 26:03.630
Should I pick her up, too?

26:06.760 --> 26:08.250
No, I can go by myself.

26:09.350 --> 26:10.000
Okay.

26:10.960 --> 26:11.420
Please.

26:26.270 --> 26:27.130
Third Brother.

26:27.440 --> 26:28.270
-Third Brother.
-You can't go in.

26:28.270 --> 26:28.880
I don't want you to come.

26:28.880 --> 26:29.440
Why are you still here?

26:29.440 --> 26:30.270
-I just have a few words.
-You can't go in.

26:30.270 --> 26:30.720
A few words.

26:30.720 --> 26:31.750
-No.
-Just a few words.

26:31.750 --> 26:33.160
Third Brother! Third Brother!

26:33.160 --> 26:34.960
Third Brother, can you help me?

26:34.990 --> 26:35.830
I'm dying,

26:35.850 --> 26:37.620
I'm dying. Third Brother.

26:40.720 --> 26:41.640
What you did

26:41.640 --> 26:42.700
at Mr. Fang's place

26:43.270 --> 26:44.130
was shameless.

26:44.600 --> 26:45.910
And you're just released.

26:45.910 --> 26:47.200
The criminal record is still fresh.

26:47.200 --> 26:47.780
Third Brother.

26:47.780 --> 26:48.910
Who in Pingchuan

26:49.640 --> 26:50.790
dares accept you?

26:50.790 --> 26:51.640
No, Third Brother.

26:51.640 --> 26:52.780
I was framed.

26:53.000 --> 26:53.680
Others believed the rumor.

26:53.680 --> 26:55.110
But you should trust me, Third Brother.

26:55.110 --> 26:56.000
I can give my life

26:56.000 --> 26:56.550
to you.

26:56.550 --> 26:58.920
-I'll work my butt off for you, okay?
-I trust you.

26:58.920 --> 27:00.820
But my boss doesn't trust you.

27:01.590 --> 27:02.240
Qiang,

27:03.030 --> 27:03.750
do your job.

27:03.750 --> 27:05.000
-Qiang.
-Just leave.

27:05.020 --> 27:07.370
Third Brother! Third Brother!

27:07.400 --> 27:08.110
Don't touch me!

27:08.110 --> 27:09.200
-Third Brother.
-It's useless.

27:09.200 --> 27:10.060
Third Brother.

27:10.270 --> 27:10.880
You...

27:10.880 --> 27:12.610
Third Brother! Third Brother!

27:15.000 --> 27:16.200
Get lost, you hear me?

27:16.590 --> 27:17.320
Here you are.

27:17.680 --> 27:18.810
Take the money and get lost.

27:18.810 --> 27:19.540
Here you are.

27:20.030 --> 27:21.760
-Take it and get lost.
-Take it.

27:21.780 --> 27:23.010
Don't push your luck.

27:32.270 --> 27:33.590
You bastard!

27:34.160 --> 27:35.340
You jerk!

27:36.000 --> 27:37.960
I did many things for you.

27:38.200 --> 27:40.330
But you want to fob me off with 200 yuan?

27:40.440 --> 27:41.350
Bastard!

27:43.440 --> 27:44.770
Do you know how to drive?

27:44.830 --> 27:45.800
You…

27:45.830 --> 27:46.680
Are you blind?

27:46.680 --> 27:47.720
Get down.

27:47.880 --> 27:48.510
Pay me!

27:48.610 --> 27:50.070
You bumped into me.

27:50.160 --> 27:51.350
Get lost.

27:51.350 --> 27:52.750
Get lost! Low-level one.

27:52.920 --> 27:54.160
Let's go. Let's go.

27:54.160 --> 27:55.070
Lu Xixiao.

27:55.110 --> 27:56.340
Lu Xixiao! Lu Xixiao!

27:56.400 --> 27:57.030
Don't go.

27:57.470 --> 27:58.060
Don't go!

27:58.400 --> 27:59.200
Lu Xixiao.

27:59.200 --> 28:00.720
It's all your fault.

28:00.980 --> 28:01.980
Lu Xixiao.

28:15.080 --> 28:15.980
Thank you.

28:16.700 --> 28:17.610
Excuse me.

28:18.220 --> 28:18.720
What?

28:18.720 --> 28:20.580
Mr. Lu asked me

28:20.600 --> 28:22.000
to talk to you.

28:22.920 --> 28:23.640
Where is he?

28:24.590 --> 28:26.470
Mr. Lu said that,

28:26.490 --> 28:27.680
well,

28:28.000 --> 28:30.040
at the wedding a few days ago,

28:30.200 --> 28:33.320
you made a scene.

28:33.340 --> 28:34.800
It has a bad influence.

28:36.060 --> 28:38.800
Mr. Lu wants you to...

28:41.110 --> 28:41.790
Where is he?

28:41.790 --> 28:43.480
Miss Guooo...

28:43.480 --> 28:44.960
-Mr. Lu. Mr. Lu
-Let go of me!

28:44.960 --> 28:47.890
-wants you to stop insulting yourself.
-Let go of me!

28:51.290 --> 28:53.250
What do you mean?

28:54.000 --> 28:55.260
Mr. Lu wants you

28:55.670 --> 28:57.340
to never come back.

29:20.460 --> 29:23.510
[Lanyue Group Share Transfer Agreement]

29:30.550 --> 29:31.240
What?

29:33.010 --> 29:35.340
I'm going to give it to my aunt,
but not you.

29:35.640 --> 29:36.640
Are you in a hurry?

29:37.230 --> 29:38.890
Is this why you called me here?

29:38.920 --> 29:40.200
In this agreement,

29:40.200 --> 29:41.720
my price is

29:41.720 --> 29:43.320
30 percent higher than hers.

29:43.440 --> 29:45.240
Besides, you are my son.

29:45.240 --> 29:46.790
How can I treat you badly?

29:47.790 --> 29:49.390
My condition is that

29:49.410 --> 29:52.010
you can study fine art

29:52.270 --> 29:54.070
or repeat your senior year.

29:54.070 --> 29:55.200
You can study

29:55.200 --> 29:56.400
wherever you want.

29:56.790 --> 29:58.510
As long as you sign this agreement,

29:58.510 --> 29:59.610
I'll support

30:00.240 --> 30:01.830
your every decision.

30:07.640 --> 30:08.880
What a loving father.

30:10.030 --> 30:11.000
If I hadn't had

30:11.000 --> 30:12.200
the things you like,

30:13.560 --> 30:15.560
would you still talk to me like that?

30:17.230 --> 30:18.080
Look at you.

30:19.510 --> 30:20.510
What about my mom?

30:23.240 --> 30:24.110
Why did you

30:24.110 --> 30:25.200
marry her?

30:26.000 --> 30:27.110
And what caused her to end up

30:27.110 --> 30:28.710
in that situation back then?

30:29.590 --> 30:31.200
Your cold-blooded selfishness

30:31.200 --> 30:33.030
will eventually make you pay.

30:37.520 --> 30:39.360
Talk to your father properly.

30:46.720 --> 30:47.510
Business

30:48.290 --> 30:49.160
and shares.

30:50.480 --> 30:51.720
That's all you know?

30:52.790 --> 30:54.960
This is the only way

30:54.960 --> 30:56.760
you talk to Grandpa, Aunt and me.

30:57.800 --> 30:58.350
Today,

30:58.350 --> 30:59.480
let me make it clear.

31:00.310 --> 31:01.240
I'm not interested

31:01.240 --> 31:02.170
in these things.

31:02.390 --> 31:03.990
I'm not going to join either.

31:05.130 --> 31:05.980
I will leave.

31:07.350 --> 31:08.920
Don't come to me.

31:09.800 --> 31:10.730
I came here today

31:10.740 --> 31:11.550
to tell you this

31:11.550 --> 31:12.400
in person.

31:14.340 --> 31:15.730
Do you think

31:17.590 --> 31:18.440
I will let you go

31:18.440 --> 31:20.400
so easily?

31:29.130 --> 31:31.260
I don't mind making a big deal out of it.

31:32.100 --> 31:33.830
But the wedding has just ended.

31:34.720 --> 31:36.200
Grandpa doesn't want

31:36.200 --> 31:38.030
our relationship

31:39.000 --> 31:39.960
to be so tough.

31:55.920 --> 31:56.680
Mr. Lu.

31:56.790 --> 31:58.270
Keep an eye on him.

31:58.270 --> 31:59.920
No matter what you do,

31:59.980 --> 32:01.110
don't let him

32:01.110 --> 32:02.400
leave Pingchuan.

32:03.970 --> 32:04.720
Got it.

32:23.420 --> 32:24.260
Xixiao,

32:25.330 --> 32:26.690
can you help me?

32:26.920 --> 32:27.990
I want to talk with

32:28.020 --> 32:29.260
your dad.

32:31.830 --> 32:32.310
I was wondering

32:32.310 --> 32:33.740
why it's so quiet today.

32:34.590 --> 32:35.070
It turns out that someone

32:35.070 --> 32:36.150
was kicked out.

32:43.190 --> 32:44.190
To put it bluntly,

32:44.530 --> 32:45.560
I don't like you.

32:47.720 --> 32:48.640
Do you think

32:48.640 --> 32:50.290
you are superior

32:50.580 --> 32:52.640
since you grew up with a silver spoon?

32:54.070 --> 32:56.040
You were fooled

32:56.070 --> 32:57.120
by Zhou Wan.

32:59.880 --> 33:01.000
Listen.

33:02.110 --> 33:03.710
If I can't have a good ending,

33:04.770 --> 33:07.550
no one in the Lu family will be happy.

33:11.260 --> 33:12.320
It doesn't matter.

33:13.480 --> 33:14.160
I don't care about

33:14.160 --> 33:15.470
the Lu family.

33:17.870 --> 33:19.110
Don't waste your time.

33:19.110 --> 33:20.180
I'd like to give you advice.

33:20.180 --> 33:22.510
You'll only get a taste of
your own medicine

33:22.510 --> 33:24.160
after calculations.

33:56.000 --> 33:56.960
Pack up.

33:56.990 --> 33:58.190
We'll leave tonight.

33:58.500 --> 33:59.960
Why are you in such a hurry?

34:01.320 --> 34:02.850
Lu Zhongyue talked with me.

34:05.330 --> 34:06.000
It's okay.

34:06.650 --> 34:07.400
If anything had happened,

34:07.400 --> 34:08.659
I wouldn't be here now.

34:09.100 --> 34:10.280
I'm just worried that he'll target you

34:10.280 --> 34:11.679
as he couldn't handle me.

34:18.600 --> 34:20.239
Actually, he came to me.

34:22.400 --> 34:23.070
When?

34:23.500 --> 34:24.360
What did he say?

34:27.110 --> 34:28.440
When we were in Yicheng.

34:31.300 --> 34:33.429
He said he wanted to
make a deal with me.

34:35.030 --> 34:36.630
As long as I return you to him,

34:38.159 --> 34:39.760
he can accept any condition.

34:45.429 --> 34:46.360
I didn't say yes.

34:52.710 --> 34:55.110
That's why you're
so afraid of coming back?

35:00.480 --> 35:01.480
Silly girl.

35:09.330 --> 35:10.670
If this happens again,

35:10.920 --> 35:12.800
just tell me, okay?

35:17.590 --> 35:19.430
I don't want you to be upset.

35:21.360 --> 35:23.710
And no matter what he says,

35:24.860 --> 35:25.910
I will reject him.

35:33.150 --> 35:34.550
I just want to be with you.

35:35.960 --> 35:37.090
We will be together.

35:37.920 --> 35:39.840
We will always,

35:39.840 --> 35:40.960
always,

35:40.960 --> 35:42.090
always be together.

35:45.620 --> 35:46.890
Let's leave tonight.

35:48.260 --> 35:49.780
Do you think I haven't thought about it?

35:49.780 --> 35:51.180
The tickets are sold out.

35:54.490 --> 35:55.820
But I've already bought

35:55.850 --> 35:57.980
the earliest tickets tomorrow morning.

35:57.980 --> 35:59.580
Come help me pack my clothes.

35:59.770 --> 36:00.770
Help me fold them.

36:02.380 --> 36:03.580
Alas.

36:04.080 --> 36:05.470
If this happens again,

36:06.090 --> 36:07.370
you should at least discuss it with me.

36:07.370 --> 36:08.700
Don't plan it secretly.

36:09.010 --> 36:10.830
I really don't want you to worry.

36:11.520 --> 36:12.250
Besides,

36:13.060 --> 36:14.330
this is perfect.

36:15.220 --> 36:16.360
Let's take away

36:16.360 --> 36:17.490
everything we need.

36:18.170 --> 36:19.570
We won't come back again.

36:22.480 --> 36:24.740
See you at the station tomorrow morning.

36:25.730 --> 36:28.080
We'll be free from now on.

37:03.030 --> 37:04.960
You came earlier than scheduled.

37:05.540 --> 37:07.470
I was delayed by something at home.

37:08.000 --> 37:09.060
I'm 5 minutes late.

37:10.160 --> 37:10.850
Come on.

37:11.190 --> 37:12.880
Try this on.

37:13.630 --> 37:15.280
This is custom-made for you.

37:16.830 --> 37:17.420
What?

37:18.760 --> 37:20.400
Mr. Chang mentioned you again

37:20.400 --> 37:21.590
when he came to my place.

37:21.590 --> 37:22.550
Next time,

37:22.550 --> 37:23.440
if we visit

37:23.440 --> 37:24.670
Mr. Chang,

37:25.150 --> 37:26.880
you have to change your outfit,

37:27.140 --> 37:27.710
right?

37:27.780 --> 37:29.000
You have to accompany me

37:29.000 --> 37:30.290
to attend more occasions.

37:30.290 --> 37:31.150
Come on, try it.

37:34.150 --> 37:34.760
This way.

37:34.800 --> 37:35.880
Go, go, go.

37:42.990 --> 37:43.680
Try it.

37:51.620 --> 37:52.140
Mr. Lu.

38:06.120 --> 38:07.320
Dad, why are you here?

38:09.480 --> 38:10.150
You're

38:10.150 --> 38:11.630
more and more outrageous.

38:11.650 --> 38:12.400
What's up?

38:12.400 --> 38:14.200
Xixiao has been back for so long.

38:14.230 --> 38:15.150
You didn't

38:15.190 --> 38:16.040
care about him at all.

38:16.040 --> 38:18.240
You only care about your shares, right?

38:18.480 --> 38:19.840
What an awful father!

38:20.000 --> 38:20.730
What's more,

38:21.360 --> 38:22.950
you even took that illegitimate son to

38:22.950 --> 38:24.710
have dinner with Mr. Chang.

38:24.810 --> 38:26.210
You want everyone to know

38:26.230 --> 38:27.480
your scandal, right?

38:27.510 --> 38:29.000
Dad, don't always

38:29.000 --> 38:30.400
call him the illegitimate child.

38:30.400 --> 38:31.070
He...

38:31.070 --> 38:32.640
He is my son.

38:32.670 --> 38:34.280
What can I do?

38:34.670 --> 38:35.880
Is Xixiao obedient?

38:36.320 --> 38:36.880
No matter what I said,

38:36.880 --> 38:38.230
he wouldn't listen to me.

38:38.230 --> 38:39.360
Luckily, the other son

38:39.360 --> 38:40.400
is doing well now.

38:40.400 --> 38:41.360
He listens to me.

38:41.440 --> 38:42.070
I can't

38:42.070 --> 38:43.730
always leave Mr. Chang there.

38:43.760 --> 38:44.480
All right.

38:44.630 --> 38:46.230
Cut the crap.

38:46.250 --> 38:47.170
You promised me

38:47.880 --> 38:49.150
not to contact

38:49.150 --> 38:49.960
that illegitimate child.

38:49.960 --> 38:50.960
Dad, why do you keep

38:50.960 --> 38:52.150
mentioning

38:52.150 --> 38:52.840
the past?

38:52.840 --> 38:54.280
It has long passed.

38:54.310 --> 38:55.800
As long as Jiang Yan is still here,

38:55.800 --> 38:57.800
this matter has not been put to rest.

38:57.920 --> 39:00.920
Only Xixiao deserves to inherit
the family business.

39:00.960 --> 39:02.630
Xixiao is a decent man.

39:03.190 --> 39:04.630
He's much better than

39:04.650 --> 39:05.820
Jiang Yan.

39:05.880 --> 39:07.770
Jiang Yan has a good character.

39:08.160 --> 39:09.730
Good? I don't think so.

39:09.760 --> 39:10.550
Dad, you...

39:10.730 --> 39:11.640
-Enough.
-You and him…

39:11.640 --> 39:13.240
I don't want to talk with you.

39:13.370 --> 39:14.640
You'll reap what you sow.

39:14.640 --> 39:15.690
Dad, okay.

39:15.720 --> 39:16.360
I...

39:16.550 --> 39:17.670
Please don't be angry.

39:17.670 --> 39:18.760
If anything happens,

39:18.760 --> 39:19.760
I'll go to your place tonight

39:19.760 --> 39:20.640
to talk to you.

39:20.960 --> 39:21.510
Dad.

39:49.550 --> 39:51.070
Did you hear that?

39:52.280 --> 39:53.400
Of course you did.

39:56.320 --> 39:57.630
This is the Lu family.

39:58.190 --> 39:59.590
You have to get used to it.

39:59.730 --> 40:03.230
If you want to be recognized,

40:03.280 --> 40:05.300
you have to prove your value,

40:05.440 --> 40:06.150
just like me

40:06.150 --> 40:07.440
and Lu Qilan.

40:08.400 --> 40:10.690
Everyone knows

40:12.070 --> 40:13.670
the competition between us.

40:16.540 --> 40:17.870
I'll prove my strength.

40:19.610 --> 40:21.440
I know you could.

40:28.250 --> 40:28.890
Zhou Wan.

40:39.130 --> 40:40.630
How did you know I was back?

40:42.280 --> 40:44.440
Your light was on. What about you?

40:45.050 --> 40:45.980
Why are you back?

40:49.470 --> 40:51.400
I came back to deal with something.

40:53.810 --> 40:55.370
Did Lu Xixiao bully you?

40:57.990 --> 40:59.270
We're good.

41:02.520 --> 41:04.000
Why are you here alone?

41:08.130 --> 41:09.610
He went back to pack up.

41:10.230 --> 41:11.290
We'll go tomorrow.

41:11.920 --> 41:12.650
Where?

41:16.890 --> 41:17.760
Yicheng.

41:19.440 --> 41:21.590
We're going to retake our senior year.

41:43.170 --> 41:44.520
Can you stay?
